 "words": 230,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The heavens are yours, and yours the earth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You founded the world and all that fills it",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "North and south you created by your word",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Tabor and Hermon sing for joy at your name",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yours is an arm of power and might",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your hand is strong, your right hand lifted high",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness and justice hold your throne",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Love and faithfulness go before you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the people who know the festal shout",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who walk, LORD, in the light of your face",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They rejoice in your name all day long",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In your righteousness they are lifted up",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For you are the glory of their strength",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By your favor you raise our horn high",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our shield belongs to the LORD alone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Our king to the Holy One of Israel",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the people who know the festal shout",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who walk, LORD, in the light of your face",
   "heard": 9,
